  "interpretation": "v181 directly conditions the compact factor on reported geometry, but both sensor arms remain 0/52 strict-safe after one unchanged CGLS step. The failure is not explained by omitting geometry from a shared factor; the chosen fixed rank-16 spectral correction is too narrow for the broad inverse mismatch.",
  "limitation": "This closes only the frozen Jacobi-whitened geometry-conditioned rank-16 family on a post-open four-frame PoolFire proxy. It is not an impossibility result for nonlinear or observation-adaptive mechanisms and establishes no deployment, resource, external, curved-ray, or real-BOST result.",
